[
    {
        "content": "<p>I found myself wanting such a function and \"API\" lemmas about it multiple times by now, and I am wondering whether it exists just under a different name in core, batteries or mathlib. Or if it does not, which of these two (equivalent) ways to define it would be recommended to get the best use of existing lemmas about <code>filter</code> or <code>fiterMap</code>? Or is there another better/shorter way to define it?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">filterAttach</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">//</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">filter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">attach</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">lt</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">lt</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp_all</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">filterAttach'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">//</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">filterMap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 614794311,
        "sender_full_name": "Malvin Gattinger",
        "timestamp": 1785944249
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><code>filterAttach</code> is unnecessarily inefficinet as you iterate the list twice so I would suggest writing the second version for programming purposes. I would probably additionally suggest to either <code>@[inline]</code> or <code>@[specialize]</code> so you get good code <span aria-label=\"tm\" class=\"emoji emoji-2122\" role=\"img\" title=\"tm\">:tm:</span></p>",
        "id": 614796545,
        "sender_full_name": "Henrik Böving",
        "timestamp": 1785944866
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Would it be appropriate to use <code>@[implemented_by]</code> relying on the data layout, if you are doing programming?</p>",
        "id": 614811916,
        "sender_full_name": "Jeremy Chen",
        "timestamp": 1785949429
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Is this <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=List.pmap#doc\">docs#List.pmap</a> ?</p>",
        "id": 614813120,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1785949847
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>No, but <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=attachWith#doc\">docs#attachWith</a> saves an iteration</p>",
        "id": 614813232,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1785949886
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Ah, so a version like this might be better for both programming and proving?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">filterAttach''</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">//</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">filter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">attachWith</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x_in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_filter</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x_in</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">2</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Also, maybe there is still a nicer version taking <code>(P : α → Bool)</code> and <code>[DecidablePred P]</code> instead?</p>",
        "id": 614969905,
        "sender_full_name": "Malvin Gattinger",
        "timestamp": 1786017890
    }
